1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,440
Good morning everyone. This is the product planning meeting for the mobile app relaunch.

2
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:10,200
We have three topics today, the onboarding redesign, the payment provider, and the launch date.

3
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,480
Let's start with onboarding.

4
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:17,720
The current flow has seven screens and we lose about 40% of users before they finish.

5
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:21,740
I tested a shorter version with three screens last week.

6
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:25,540
Completion went from 60 to 82% in the prototype.

7
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,620
That's a big improvement.

8
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:30,660
So do we agree to ship the three screen onboarding?

9
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:34,800
Yes, I agree. Let's go with three screens.

10
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:40,140
Agreed. I will finish the final designs by Thursday and share them with engineering.

11
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,880
Great. Next topic, the payment provider.

12
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:46,260
We are choosing between Stripe and Adyen.

13
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:51,940
Adyen has lower fees for Brazil, but the integration would take about three more weeks.

14
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,240
Stripe we could integrate in one week.

15
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,060
I am worried about the fees long term.

16
00:00:57,380 --> 00:01:00,100
Brazil is going to be our biggest market next year.

17
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,940
I don't think we can decide this today.

18
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:08,740
Daniel, can you prepare a cost comparison for 12 months, including the engineering time?

19
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:12,980
Sure. I will have the comparison ready by next Monday.

20
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,740
Last topic, the launch date.

21
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,860
Marketing wants March 15th.

22
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:21,080
March 15th is risky if we pick Adyen.

23
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:23,380
We would have almost no buffer for testing.

24
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:26,840
Then the launch date depends on the payment decision.

25
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:29,620
Let's not commit to March 15th yet.

26
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:30,800
Okay.

27
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:35,320
We keep March 15th as a target, but we confirm it after the payment decision.

28
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:37,080
I will tell marketing today.

29
00:01:37,540 --> 00:01:38,260
Thanks, everyone.

30
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,760
See you next week.
